Spec: EngineeringLevels
L1: simple / small-scale
L2: modular / growing
L3: distributed / higher reliability
L4: large-scale / multi-region or high availability
L5: extreme-scale / complex distributed systems
SelectionInputs: users DAU MAU QPS latency availability regions data_volume compliance security team_size deployment business_criticality
Rules:
  AI MUST select the lowest level that satisfies explicit requirements.
  AI MUST NOT introduce microservices, Kubernetes, Kafka, sharding, multi-region, or similar complexity without evidence.
